            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Linkers Industries announces receives non-compliance letter from Nasdaq",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Linkers Industries (LNKS) announced receipt of Nasdaq Minimum Bid Price Deficiency Letter. On March 10, Linkers Industries received a letter from the Listing Qualifications staff of The Nasdaq Stock Market notifying the Company that based on the closing bid price of the Company for the period from January 24, 2025 to March 7, 2025, the Company no longer meets the continued listing requirement of Nasdaq under Nasdaq Listing Rules 5550(a)(2), to maintain a minimum bid price of $1 per share. Nasdaq",
